ng that  determination was followed by rallies  this isn't  just a mental health issue walkouts and  a worldwide day of marches voters are  coming but the school shootings  continued when we met just after the  Parkwood shooting you guys said never  again  but sadly since then there's been  Noblesville dixon santa fe we said never  again no like damn well that would  happen again we said never again because  this should have never happened again  the young people of this country are  inheriting the world we are walking into  the future and all we want is for it to  be a safer better place  we have no horse in this race besides  not getting shot though many are too  young to vote they plan to shape the  election for CBS this morning Saturday  Adriana Diaz Chicago
 

